---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Case law" canonicalPath="/case-law">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head" style="padding-top:24px">
      <div class="eyebrow">Judgments</div>
      <h1 style="margin-top:8px">Case law</h1>
      <p>Judgments are added only after the court, date and holding are verified.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose"><div class="card"><b>No verified judgments on the 2025 Act yet.</b><p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 0">The Act took effect on 1 April 2026, so authoritative rulings on its wording are still emerging. Cases decided under the 1961 Act will be listed only where verified.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
